{"Title":"An Act authorizing municipalities to use funds for flood control infrastructure and floodplain preservation","BillNumber":"S138","DocketNumber":"SD767","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"JCV0","Name":"John C. Velis","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JCV0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T11:57:54.287"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"JCV0","Name":"John C. Velis","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JCV0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T11:57:54.2866667"},{"Id":"KWP1","Name":"Kelly W. Pease","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/KWP1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-31T10:53:00.4433333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S138/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Mr. Velis, a petition (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 138) of John C. Velis and Kelly W. Pease for legislation to authorize municipalities to use funds for flood control infrastructure and floodplain preservation.  Community Development and Small Businesses.","DocumentText":"\tSubsection (c) of section 5 of chapter 44B of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2022 Official Edition, is hereby amended by inserting after the words “support of community housing;” the following words:- for the rehabilitation or restoration of historical or recreational projects that are acquired or created prior to 2000, including but not limited to, flood control infrastructures, floodplain preservation;\r\n\tSubsection (c) of section 5 of chapter 44B of the General Laws, is hereby amended by inserting after the words “shall not be used for” the following words;- regular upkeep and general.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J47","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J47"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}